* Front-panel waveform switch, drawing1448 (circuit00), oscillators1/2.
* The hybrid connects saw and triangle through R03047K and R03110K.
* Table7-2 FRONT PANEL ASSEMBLY specifies both at±5%,1/2W.
* Defaults retain the drawing/BOM. A reference calibration must pass its
* equivalent resistance explicitly; it does not change the drawn part value.
.subckt mm_shark_source saw tri wave params:r030=47k r031=10k
r030 saw wave {r030}
r031 tri wave {r031}
.ends mm_shark_source
